# ===========================================================================
# Engineer Cafe Navigator — Monorepo Environment Variables
# ===========================================================================
#
# This monorepo has separate env files for frontend and backend.
# Do NOT create a root-level .env — each service manages its own.
#
# Quick start:
#
#   # Frontend (Next.js)
#   cp frontend/.env.example frontend/.env.local
#
#   # Backend (FastAPI)
#   cp backend/.env.example backend/.env
#
# For production/staging deployment configs, see:
#   - frontend/.env.production.example   (Vercel)
#   - backend/.env.production.example    (Cloud Run)
#   - backend/.env.staging.example       (Cloud Run staging)
#
# Shared services (Supabase, GCP, OpenAI) are configured independently
# in each directory's .env.example with appropriate defaults.
